                <head>[Indorsements.]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Headquarters Department of
                            Texas</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic">Galveston,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1866-01-03"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >January</hi> 3, 1866.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Respectfully forwarded with report of the commission which investigated the case.
                    The original papers are also herewith.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>H. G. WRIGHT, <hi rendition="#italic">Major General
                        Commanding.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
